## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ABAC, cross-account trust, per-tenant encryption, and test rigor for production-grade data lakes.

## Key Concepts
- ABAC with IAM tags and S3 object tags
- Per-tenant KMS CMKs and encryption context
- Cross-account role with least privilege
- Test plan including canaries and revocation

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject","s3:ListBucket"],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::telemetry-lake/tenant-id=${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}/*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "s3:ExistingObjectTag/tenant-id": "${aws:PrincipalTag/tenant-id}"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
